00:01:57.429 --> 00:01:59.750
speaking on air that perpetuated it.

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:04.469
It was just sort of how the stress that was
going on elsewhere in your life manifested.

00:02:04.469 --> 00:02:07.239
I think I think for me, there had always.

00:02:07.239 --> 00:02:08.239
There had.

00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:15.220
And is there had been and still is a baseline
amount of nerves when it comes to speaking

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:16.220
publicly.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.220
Right.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:25.640
So but but the the changes to my brain chemistry
